ritime or international law"", and the party defiantly vowed to ""stand up for British interests"", whether French President","Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:29:32 GMT",https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260803-hard-right-reform-uk-proposes-navy-led-operation-to-stop-small-migrant-boats,2026-08-04 01:17:25
