Lenta (RU),Russia,ru,Размер средней зарплаты превысил отметку в 200 тысяч рублей в трех регионах России,The average salary exceeded 200 thousand rubles in three regions of Russia,"The average salary exceeded 200 thousand rubles in three regions of Russia Advertising In May 2026, the average salary exceeded 200 thousand rubles in three regions of Russia. This was reported by TASS with reference to Rosstat data. The Chukotka Autonomous Okrug is in first place - the average salary there was 260.7 thousand rubles. Following it is the Magadan region with an indicator of 214.4 thousand rubles. The top three for this indicator is closed by the Yamalo-Nenets Autonomous Okrug, where on average workers received 205.3 thousand rubles. It is noted that throughout the country the average salary in May was 110,216 rubles. It was previously reported that in May the salaries of private detectives increased sharply - 2.1 times in annual terms, amounting to 174.1 thousand rubles.","Tue, 04 Aug 2026 02:34:34 +0300",https://lenta.ru/news/2026/08/04/razmer-sredney-zarplaty-prevysil-otmetku-v-200-tysyach-rubley-v-treh-regionah-rossii/,2026-08-04 01:18:59
