 17:51:39 +0530",https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/israeli-strikes-northern-gaza-city-and-jabalia-israeli-minister-eli-cohen-says-no-deal-to-halt-attacks/article71297603.ece,2026-08-04 01:21:09
