Times of India,India (Mainstream),en,"Quote of the day by Serena Williams: ""I really think a champion is defined not by their wins, but by…""","Quote of the day by Serena Williams: ""I really think a champion is defined not by their wins, but by…""","Quote of the day by Serena Williams: ""I really think a champion is defined not by their wins, but by…"" <img align=""left"" border=""0"" hspace=""10"" src=""https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132836666.cms"" style=""margin-top: 3px; margin-right: 5px;"" />Serena Williams believes champions are defined by their recovery after falling. True character emerges during moments of defeat, not just victory. Setbacks are an unavoidable part of any genuine journey toward growth. Resilience allows individuals to adapt and try again after disappointment. This powerful message extends beyond sports to all life's challenges.",2026-08-03T22:07:29+05:30,https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-serena-williams-i-really-think-a-champion-is-defined-not-by-their-wins-but-by-a-powerful-lesson-on-resilience-and-rising-after-failure/articleshow/132836666.cms,2026-08-04 01:21:51
